msgid "Ami「I just feel like it right now. If things＿work out between Yuusaku and that＿cold-hearted woman...... Maybe I'll be」"
msgstr "Ami「Ahora mismo solo me dan ganas. Si las＿cosas salen bien entre Yuusaku y esa＿mujer sin corazón...... Quizá yo sea」"

msgid "Ami「the next one in line for a chance like＿that.」"
msgstr "Ami「la siguiente en la fila para＿una oportunidad así.」"

msgid "Ami「What's next after talking about food?＿\"Some weather we're having\"? Or＿maybe \"What did you watch on TV last」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué sigue tras hablar de comida?＿¿\"Qué tal el clima hoy\"?」"

msgid "Ami「night\"?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿O tal vez \"Qué viste＿en la tele anoche\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No matter how much you like＿something, turning it into a career＿must be hard. I think you could stand」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por mucho que te guste algo, hacerlo＿tu profesión debe ser duro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「to be more proud of it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Creo que deberías sentirte＿más orgullosa de ello.」"

msgid "Ami「Interested in dieting? Quit while you're＿ahead. Even if Ami-chan tells you,＿we're so different that it won't be of」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Te interesa hacer dieta? Mejor déjalo.」"

msgid "Ami「any use to you.」"
msgstr "Ami「Aunque Ami-chan te diga, somos tan＿distintos que no te servirá de nada.」"

msgid "Ami「If that scrap of paper is what you want,＿I'll give it to you. Get out some＿stationery. And I'll throw in \"To Mr.」"
msgstr "Ami「Si quieres ese papel, te lo＿doy. Saca papel de carta.」"

msgid "Ami「Takasu\" for you. Come on, hurry up!」"
msgstr "Ami「Y te pondré \"Para el señor Takasu\".＿¡Vamos, date prisa!」"

msgid "Ami「He's so susceptible to psychological＿damage～ When Yuusaku starts＿sulking, he just becomes more of a」"
msgstr "Ami「Es tan vulnerable al daño psicológico～＿Cuando Yuusaku se enfurruña, después＿se vuelve una」"

msgid "Ami「hassle later on.」"
msgstr "Ami「molestia aún mayor.」"

msgid "Ami「Don't remind me of boring things. As＿childhood friends, we have an＿understanding of each other's weak」"
msgstr "Ami「No me recuerdes cosas aburridas.」"

msgid "Ami「points.」"
msgstr "Ami「Como amigos de la infancia, conocemos＿mutuamente nuestros puntos débiles.」"

msgid "Ami「You're really going to ask me that? If＿there's nothing you want to talk to me＿about, why don't you just tell me」"
msgstr "Ami「¿De verdad me vas a preguntar eso? Si＿no hay nada de lo que quieras hablar＿conmigo, ¿por qué no me lo dices」"

msgid "Ami「directly? Sorry I can't kill time with＿you!」"
msgstr "Ami「directamente? ¡Perdón por no poder＿matar el tiempo contigo!」"

msgid "Ami「Impressive? Going to America alone＿after all her effort to make him＿miserable? Personally, I think that's」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Impresionante? ¿Irse sola a EE. UU.＿tras esmerarse en hacerlo infeliz?」"

msgid "Ami「just selfish.」"
msgstr "Ami「En lo personal, eso me parece＿simplemente egoísta.」"

msgid "Ami「I hate the whole student council＿system, and for a \"president\" to go and＿get normal students tangled up in her」"
msgstr "Ami「Odio todo el sistema del consejo＿estudiantil, y que una \"presidenta\"＿meta a estudiantes normales en sus」"

msgid "Ami「love issues, I especially hate that＿woman!」"
msgstr "Ami「problemas amorosos, ¡odio＿en especial a esa mujer!」"
